{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-tenet-16w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn Tenet 16W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Caliburn TENET 16W Pod System, featuring a 750mAh battery, rugged exterior design, and is compatible with Caliburn G\/G2 Coils and Pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"Uwell Caliburn G2 Pods\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g2-empty-cartridge\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G2 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca title=\"Uwell Caliburn G2 Coils\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g2-replacement-coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G2 Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g-replacement-coils\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn G Coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable aluminum alloy, the Caliburn Tenet Pod System delivers a strong and impervious chassis, updating the sleek metal unibody design with a new rugged exterior. In addition, Uwell has introduced haptic feedback to make the Caliburn Tenet much more intuitive. Operating off dual firing modes, like its predecessors, the Caliburn TENET can be button or draw-activated, making vaping a breeze. Furthermore, the TENET can call upon the Caliburn G or G2 Pods and Coils to deliver outstanding flavor and vapor from your favorite eJuice or nicotine salts and can adjust the airflow via pod based rotating dial.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUwell Caliburn TENET 16W Pod System Features:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 110.9mm by 25.1mm by 16.3mm\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 750mAh\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax Wattage Output: 16W\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Aluminum-Alloy\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C Port\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Button \/ Draw Activated Firing\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Series: Uwell Caliburn G2 Pods\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Top Fill\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Material: PCTG\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2mL\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Installation: Press Fit\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Support: Uwell Caliburn G\/G2 Coils\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHaptic Feedback\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePRO-FOCS Technology\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eJuice Level Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn TENET\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn G2 Pods\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm Caliburn G Coil\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm Caliburn G2 Coil\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42016243089463,"sku":"U Cali Tenet Pod System","price":4650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_tenet_pod_system_-_olive_green.webp?v=1765239336","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-tenet-16w-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




